# Skill divergence log (Hermes)

Findings recorded by `/log-skill-divergence`: moments when a Bitpool Hermes skill's documented claim
proved wrong, its workflow had a gap, or it failed to trigger when it should have.

Each row links to one file. Newest first. Append-only: add rows at the top, never rewrite what is
already here. When a log is processed it moves to `Archive/YY-MM/` (the month it was resolved) and
its link here is repointed. The row itself never moves.

Nothing in here is a change to a skill. These are proposals. `/skill-health` surfaces them; acting on
one is `/edit-skill` (a pull request to `Lolman-bot/Hermes-Repository-`), and whoever resolves a log
updates its row's status in the same pass.

